        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: If Alice does not get heads (probability \\( \\frac{1}{2} \\)), then it becomes Bob's turn. Bob wins if he gets tails, which has a probability of \\( \\frac{1}{2} \\). If Bob does not get tails (probability \\( \\frac{1}{2} \\)), the game returns to Alice."
