        "text": "Step 4: Let \\( P \\) be the probability that Alice wins the game. We can set up the equation based on the above reasoning:\n\\[ P = \\frac{1}{2} + \\left( \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\times P \\right) \\]\nThis equation accounts for Alice winning immediately or the game returning to Alice after both fail to win on their respective turns."
